# AGENTS.md Local Overrides Example

# Copy this file to AGENTS.local.md and customize for your local development needs
# This file is .gitignored and will not be committed to version control

# User-specific preferences
## Personal Development Commands
```bash
# Your preferred test runner
npm run test:watch

# Your preferred build command
npm run build:fast

# Your preferred database reset
pnpm db:reset:local
```

## Custom Tool Preferences
- **Preferred IDE**: VS Code with specific extensions
- **Preferred Browser**: Chrome for development
- **Preferred Terminal**: Windows Terminal with PowerShell

## Project-Specific Settings
- **Default Tenant**: tenant-1 for local development
- **Test Data**: Use local test data fixtures
- **Debug Mode**: Enable verbose logging

## Custom Aliases
```bash
# Quick commands you use frequently
alias dev="pnpm dev"
alias build="pnpm build"
alias test="pnpm test"
```

## Environment Overrides
- **Skip certain checks**: Disable specific linting rules locally
- **Enable hot reload**: Always use hot reload in development
- **Mock external services**: Use local mocks for APIs

## Notes
- Add any personal preferences that help you work more efficiently
- This file takes precedence over the root AGENTS.md
- Keep it focused on your personal workflow optimizations
